# Software archive: Zenodo
type: software
title: "AlgoPlasma: Open Algorithms for Plasma Modeling"
version: "v1.0.1"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23227612"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AlgoPlasma, formerly PMSL, is an open-source library of reusable numerical
  algorithms for plasma modeling, verification, and education.
keywords:
  - plasma modeling
  - numerical algorithms
  - particle-in-cell
  - parallel computing
  - verification and validation
  - scientific software

